{"id":872,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>近日，第六届高校航院大学生优秀年度总结计划评选落下帷幕，本次活动由全国航院大思政联盟主办，覆盖全国航空航天专业学院，旨在引导学生复盘年度成长、规划未来发展。我院学生首次参赛，荣获多项奖励，高正阳获二等奖，赵一博、任燚轩获三等奖，马尚政、张雅翔获优秀奖。</p><p>复盘总结是向内的自我回望，发展规划是向前的行动指引。本次获奖同学以笔墨镌刻成长，以反思明晰航向，充分彰显我院学子勤学善思、矢志航空报国的优良风貌。期盼全体航院学子对标榜样力量，常思自省、笃行实干，怀揣专业热爱奋勇向前，深耕航空领域，肩负民航重任，以青春身影逐梦蓝天，勇担时代使命、报效家国！</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lLzCrsU8-YLmCioIRr7oz98M4Q2Ll-5bLlUPnzvbnRM7Mml0gihFp2hmCIa0nkyPn1y4LShRLm7DMm9ZnRl8o7W7M7lbMR-8ozl4nRWVnzAFLNLinNUYL8WFM8VfLz7Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PM4lsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11757&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/D1F31C216688D548BD4E9424953D2EE8/2C5FD23B/7AA11\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lLzCrsU8-YLmCioIRr7oz98M4Q2Ll-5bLlUPnzvbnRM7Mml0gihFp2hmCIa0nkyPn1y4LShRLm7DMm9ZnRl8o7W7M7lbMR-8ozl4nRWVnzAFLNLinNUYL8WFM8VfLz7Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PM4lsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11757&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://hkyh.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lLzCrsU8-YLmCioIRr7oz98M4Q2Ll-5bLlUPnzvbnRM7Mml0gihFp2hmCIa0nkyPn1y4LShRLm7DMm9ZnRl8o7W7M7lbMR-8ozl4nRWVnzAFLNLinNUYL8WFM8VfLz7Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PM4lsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11757&e=.jpg"}